cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DISP-S1 Evaluation Framework"
abstract: >
  A reproducible evaluation framework for the OPERA Level-3 DISP-S1
  Sentinel-1 displacement product against independent geodetic ground
  truth from continuous GNSS networks, with a uniform processor
  abstraction for cross-processor comparison against MintPy, MiaplPy,
  HyP3-SBAS, and PyGMTSAR.
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Shubham
keywords:
  - InSAR
  - OPERA
  - DISP-S1
  - Sentinel-1
  - GNSS
  - validation
  - subsidence
  - geodesy
license: MIT
